[
  {
    "id": "TOILET.BIN:text:0563",
    "en": " Huh... I envy your self-confidence...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Oh... J'envie ton assurance...(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "TOILET.BIN:text:0564",
    "en": "  Hey! You're forgetting to add \"totally\"!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Hé! Tu oublies d'ajouter \"complètement\"!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "TOILET.BIN:text:0565",
    "en": "   Hee hee! If you get angry, your blood{SAUT}pressure's gonna rise!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Hihi! Si tu t'énerves, ta tension{SAUT}artérielle va augmenter!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "TOILET.BIN:text:0566",
    "en": "   Hee hee! It's 'cause it's just how you{SAUT}wanted it, mister!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Hihi! C'est parce que c'est ainsi que tu{SAUT}le souhaitais, monsieur!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "TOILET.BIN:text:0567",
    "en": "  ...Things aren't getting any livelier...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "...C'est pas plus animé pour autant...(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "TOILET.BIN:text:0568",
    "en": "   I don't really get it... but I'm scared!{SAUT}W-Waaaaaah!(*RESPONSE*)",
